//SMALL SHIELD +1 - 1000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/SHLD02A.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Small Shield"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "A small shield is usually round and is carried on the forearm, gripped with the shield hand. Its light weight as compared to a medium shield permits the user to carry other items in that hand, although <PRO_HESHE> cannot wield or carry another weapon. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: +1
– No protection against missile attacks

Requires:
 8 Strength

Weight: 3
"

	SAY NAME2 "Small Shield +1"
	SAY DESC "A small shield is usually round and is carried on the forearm, gripped with the shield hand. Its light weight as compared to a medium shield permits the user to carry other items in that hand, although <PRO_HESHE> cannot wield or carry another weapon. This particular shield is enchanted, granting an additional protection to its wearer.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: +2
– No protection against missile attacks

Requires:
 8 Strength

Weight: 3
"




